{"sha":"24f6008564183aa120d07c03d9289519c2fe02af","node_id":"C_kwDOACN7MtoAKDI0ZjYwMDg1NjQxODNhYTEyMGQwN2MwM2Q5Mjg5NTE5YzJmZTAyYWY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Eric W. Biederman","email":"ebiederm@xmission.com","date":"2022-01-20T17:04:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"Tejun Heo","email":"tj@kernel.org","date":"2022-02-01T17:28:00Z"},"message":"cgroup-v1: Require capabilities to set release_agent\n\nThe cgroup release_agent is called with call_usermodehelper.  The function\ncall_usermodehelper starts the release_agent with a full set fo capabilities.\nTherefore require capabilities when setting the release_agaent.\n\nReported-by: Tabitha Sable <tabitha.c.sable@gmail.com>\nTested-by: Tabitha Sable <tabitha.c.sable@gmail.com>\nFixes: 81a6a5cdd2c5 (\"Task Control Groups: automatic userspace notification of idle cgroups\")\nCc: stable@vger.kernel.org # v2.6.24+\nSigned-off-by: \"Eric W. Biederman\" <ebiederm@xmission.com>\nSigned-off-by: Tejun Heo <tj@kernel.org>","tree":{"sha":"116de0e1cf8b69ec7bdc1fec15a9a623d77eee04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/trees/116de0e1cf8b69ec7bdc1fec15a9a623d77eee04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/commits/24f6008564183aa120d07c03d9289519c2fe02af","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/24f6008564183aa120d07c03d9289519c2fe02af","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/24f6008564183aa120d07c03d9289519c2fe02af","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/24f6008564183aa120d07c03d9289519c2fe02af/comments","author":{"login":"ebiederm","id":7477136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NzcxMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7477136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebiederm","html_url":"https://github.com/ebiederm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ebiederm/followers","following_url"